            <ArticleTitle>Controlling breakthrough pain in palliative care.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>53-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article challenges the common practice of boosting the syringe driver as a means of controlling breakthrough pain. The authors offer some guidelines for good practice for managing the MS26 syringe driver when used for pain control.</AbstractText>
